    "notes": "Cumulative delta is not available in OHLCV, so it is proxied by the LookbackPeriod 20 average of signed close-open volume, and the documented breakout is a new 20-bar extreme of that series (prior-bar window so the current bar is not self-referential). The exit is the documented cross back through zero, and the stop is referenced but never quantified, so the stop fields are null."
